<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1990/10/eng@/~cl_2> <https://schema.org/text> "Article 48 of the Federal Constitution is amended by ment of inserting, immediately after Clause (5), the following Article 48. new Clause (6): \"(6) A person who resigns his membership of the House of Representatives shall, for a period of five years beginning with the date on which his resignation takes effect, be disqualified from being a member of the House of Representatives.\". Amendment"@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1990/10/eng@> .
